    "text": {
     "en": "Evaporation is faster when it is warm, windy, dry and when the surface is wide. Wet clothes dry quickly spread out in the sun.\nEvaporation causes cooling. Sweat evaporating cools our body and water in an earthen pot stays cool as it evaporates through tiny pores.\nWe use this cooling in daily life, such as a wet cloth on the forehead."
